OL,3,GNEWSASecond boy arrested over city
OL,4,Acentre stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second teenage boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a stabbing in Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,8,Fpolice say.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Upper Market
OL,11,FSquare in Hanley at 17:50 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday to a report that a teenage boy
OL,13,Fhad been stabbed in a fight involving a
OL,14,Fgroup of young people.
OL,16,FOn the same day, a 17-year-old boy,
OL,17,Ffrom Stafford, was taken to hospital
OL,18,Fand arrested on suspicion of possession
OL,19,Fof a bladed article in a public place
OL,20,Fand affray. He remained in hospital on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
